Package: veltos-llama
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: llama.cpp's server for VeltOS AI's local model
 The language model engine VeltOS AI uses for its local, offline model:
 llama.cpp's llama-server, built by VeltOS from a pinned, checksum-verified
 llama.cpp release (Debian 13 has no llama.cpp package). It runs GGUF
 models on the processor, picking the best code for the CPU at start
 (SSE4.2, AVX2, AVX-512 ...), and listens only on 127.0.0.1 when VeltOS AI
 starts it. No model is included; VeltOS AI downloads one on request.
